  <section><para>Solve the system of equations using elimination. Check the solution by graphing.</para>
<para>\(\begin{array}{rcl}&amp;&amp;\left\{\begin{array}{l}2x\;–\;4y\;=\;–26\\-3x\;+\;4y\;=\;29\end{array}\right.\end{array}\)</para></section>
